{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/5988bbfec60bf1bfe3126e8c51591be7.avif?t=1760446909\" width=600 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/1484d75900cb96956d4ea61b9219f023.poster.avif?t=1760446909\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/1484d75900cb96956d4ea61b9219f023.webm?t=1760446909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/1484d75900cb96956d4ea61b9219f023.mp4?t=1760446909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for a treasure-filled adventure beneath the waves! Merge coins and gems to uncover riches beyond imagination!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover maps that change how you play, each with its own unique shape and background. Can you master them all and merge the biggest treasure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/c592289d502a566ae1776f45b4190b9f.avif?t=1760446909\" width=600 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/b2c637961171afc9291bbbaaebf0517d.poster.avif?t=1760446909\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/b2c637961171afc9291bbbaaebf0517d.webm?t=1760446909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/b2c637961171afc9291bbbaaebf0517d.mp4?t=1760446909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO-OP mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together locally inside one dome and collect points as a team! Merge treasures, grab power-ups, and try to reach the highest score side by side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VERSUS mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge a friend locally! The dome is split in half - one side for you, one side for your opponent. If one player overfills their dome and items spill out, the other has only a few seconds left to score as many points as possible before the game ends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch amazing power-ups as they float to the surface and use them whenever you want:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bomb: Explodes and pushes everything away</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pearl: Merges with any treasure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ruby Curse: Makes treasure even more valuable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Eruption: Destroys all stones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Specter: Lets your treasure pass through obstacles</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Online leaderboards to show off your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Co-op mode to play and merge together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Versus mode to challenge your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 2 maps with unique shapes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 5 exciting power-ups that can change everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Fully customizable name and character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Wide range of character skins: from underwater to out of this world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A bright and dazzling underwater look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swim to the top and rule the leaderboard!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3165470?t=1760446909","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/f12ce138d2d6e71b7b9db9331ca2a3ce75927b5d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760446909","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/28ff2dc60a47f859b961d278d36a2a563bea3da7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760446909","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/28ff2dc60a47f859b961d278d36a2a563bea3da7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760446909","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/5988bbfec60bf1bfe3126e8c51591be7.avif?t=1760446909\" width=600 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/1484d75900cb96956d4ea61b9219f023.poster.avif?t=1760446909\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai