 one side for your opponent. If one player overfills their dome and items spill out, the other has only a few seconds left to score as many points as possible before the game ends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch amazing power-ups as they float to the surface and use them whenever you want:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bomb: Explodes and pushes everything away</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pearl: Merges with any treasure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ruby Curse: Makes treasure even more valuable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Eruption: Destroys all stones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Specter: Lets your treasure pass through obstacles</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Online leaderboards to show off your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Co-op mode to play and merge together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Versus mode to challenge your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 2 maps with unique shapes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 5 exciting power-ups that can change everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Fully customizable name and character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Wide range of character skins: from underwater to out of this world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A bright and dazzling underwater look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swim to the top and rule the leaderboard!</strong></p>","developers":["QubicGames","Bolt Goblin"],"dlc":[4018440,4018450,4018460,4018470],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/41e5268751b2494a42f769dedb82ce5dfe11622e/header.jpg?t=1760446909","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 QubicGames S.A. <br />\r\n\u00a9 2025 Bolt Goblin","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul